<title>CANADA: William Resources buys Utah contractor.</title>
<headline>William Resources buys Utah contractor.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>William Resources Inc said on Wednesday it has acquired Centennial Development Inc, a mine contractor company based in Salt Lake City, Utah.</p>
<p>William Resources said it bought the contractor through its wholly owned subsidiary, BLM Service Group, an engineering, consulting and contracting firm, for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>The acquisition will broaden BLM's services and lead to increased revenues for William Resources, the gold company said in a statement.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
